description: Explores init unsatisfiable and next read_primed with check invariant_non_boolean.
ref: tlc2/tool/impl/Tool.java#getInitStates; tlc2/tool/impl/Tool.java#getNextStates
features:
  - state-space
outcome: any
config: |
  INIT Init
  NEXT Next
  INVARIANT Inv
---*)
---- MODULE space_unsatisfiable__read_primed__invariant_non_boolean ----
EXTENDS Integers
VARIABLES x, y
vars == <<x, y>>
Assign(a, b) == x = a /\ y = b
Same(a, b) == a = a /\ b = b
Init == x = 0 /\ y = 0 /\ x = 1
Next == x' = x /\ y' = x'
Inv == 1
====

